<td id="A3.T5.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A3.T5.2.17.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Answer: Temporary blackout of previous context. Nothing retained.</span></td></tr>
